ype":"paragraph","text":"最後は～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い可愛いももこのお姉様"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF6EKFTM3PYKBMMGSK87900","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日の生ドルがね、\nすごくすごく楽しかったよ！\nって写真だよーーっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF6EMJKCPDY79MAGNV3EQ9W","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"> 今日はね勇気が出る日！松村さんにおさわり占いしてもらって、だからももこ今日がんばるのー！\nがんばりまっちゅん！♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてどうもありがとう。"}],"source":"archive"}